{"school":{"dbn":"18K961","name":"Lenox Academy","boro":"Brooklyn","district":"18","district_label":"District 18","report_type":"EMS","report_types":"EMS","school_type":"Middle","grades":"6 to 8","status":"open","enrollment":264,"enrollment_year":"2024-25","address":"1000 FLATLANDS AVE, BROOKLYN, NY 11234","phone":"718-964-1180","website":null,"directory_url":"https://www.myschools.nyc/en/schools/middle-school/70938","accessibility":"Not Accessible","overview":"Lenox Academy M.S. 961 is a new academically accelerated program for middle school students. We provide a high-quality education in a small, loving and supportive environment. Lenox Academy's rigorous academic program, coupled with a highly skilled and experienced staff, has proven successful, as nearly all of our 8th great students confidently sit for three Regents exams and the Spanish Proficiency Exam. At Lenox, our motto is \u00c3\u0083\u00c2\u00a2\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u0080\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u009cFind your passion ~ Find your voice.\u00c3\u0083\u00c2\u00a2\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u0080\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u009d  Through our Electives classes, students are able to experience enrichment in areas they are passionate about during the school day.  Through our robust student government, and our advisory program, which allows students to give regular input on school decisions, students develop their unique voices. Lenox Academy promotes academic excellence and challenges students to meet NYS standards with distinction. Our seniors are administered the English Language Arts and Algebra I Common Core Regents, Living Environment Regents and Spanish Proficiency exams. The arts experts at Pure Elements, our SONYC after school partner, offer a high quality afterschool program featuring expert instruction in technology, culinary arts, dance, theater, basketball, volleyball, and more.","start_time":"08:00am","end_time":"02:19pm","languages":null,"subway":"L to Canarsie - Rockaway Parkway","bus":"B103, B17, B42, B6, B60, B82, B82-